1134
00:47:30.950 --> 00:47:34.450
The unpredictable good times a cat offers.
猫带来的不可预知的快乐时光。

1135
00:47:34.450 --> 00:47:38.870
You know, cats really do offer unpredictable good times.
你知道，猫确实能带来不可预知的快乐时光。

1136
00:47:39.730 --> 00:47:42.970
Creed Bratton has texted me this sentence.
克里德·布拉顿给我发短信说了这句话。

1137
00:47:43.650 --> 00:47:46.650
An unpredictable good time only a cat offers.
只有猫才能带来的不可预知的快乐时光。

1138
