I had to research drinking in order to play drunk Pam.
为了演好喝醉的帕姆，我不得不去研究喝酒。

1183
00:49:58.130 --> 00:49:59.870
So, I took a sip of it.
所以，我抿了一口。

1184
00:49:59.950 --> 00:50:00.210
Yeah.
嗯。

1185
00:50:00.410 --> 00:50:03.850
