我把它写下来了。

1257
00:53:06.560 --> 00:53:07.780
There's a diabetes shot.
这是糖尿病注射剂。

1258
00:53:08.040 --> 00:53:09.340
Roll the insulin in your hands.
把胰岛素放在手心里滚匀。

1259
00:53:09.580 --> 00:53:10.220
Don't shake it.
不要摇晃它。

1260
00:53:10.460 --> 00:53:12.160
She gets an ACE inhibitor with her meal.
她吃饭时要服用一种血管紧张素转化酶抑制剂。

1261
00:53:12.360 --> 00:53:15.580
If you have to put her right in front of the dish or she won't see it because of the cataracts.
如果你必须把她直接放在餐盘前，否则因为白内障她会看不见。

1262
00:53:16.240 --> 00:53:19.700
Mix one capsule of omega fatty acid in with her kidney medicine.
把一粒欧米茄脂肪酸胶囊混在她的肾脏药物里。

1263
00:53:20.440 --> 00:53:23.660
And you want to give that to her 15 minutes after she's eaten.
你得在她吃完饭15分钟后喂给她。

1264
00:53:24.460 --> 00:53:28.340
And oh, there's a fungal cream because she has this infection under her tail.
哦，还有一种真菌药膏，因为她的尾巴下面有感染。

1265
00:53:28.440 --> 00:53:31.840
So you're going to have to lift her tail and put the cream right at the base of her tail.
所以你得抬起她的尾巴，把药膏涂在尾巴根部。

1266
00:53:32.480 --> 00:53:37.160
I love that you memorized it, Angela, because when I watched that, I wondered.
安吉拉，我很高兴你把它背下来了，因为我看的时候就在想。

1267
00:53:37.300 --> 00:53:42.420
